# Day 10 – Student Profile

## Overview

This task implements the Student Profile component for the Salesforce Student Placement application.

The Student Profile allows a student to view and update their profile information directly from the Student Record Page.

## Student Profile Fields

- Student Name
- CGPA
- Branch
- Backlogs
- Email
- Phone
- Skills
- Preferred Location

## Features

- Display student information
- Edit student information
- Update profile information
- Save profile changes
- Required field validation
- Success feedback
- Error handling

## Student Profile Workflow

```text
Student Record
      ↓
Student Profile
      ↓
Edit Profile
      ↓
Enter / Update Details
      ↓
Validation
      ↓
Save Profile
      ↓
Student Record Updated
      ↓
Success Message
